{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33592","headline":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 一 · 许棠","name":"讲德陈情上淮南李仆射八首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天降贤人佐圣时，自然声教满华夷。\n英明不独中朝仰，清重兼闻外国知。\n凉夜酒醒多对月，晓庭公退半吟诗。\n梁城东下虽经战，风俗犹传守旧规。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许棠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33592.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33592","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}